sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as 客户端租户A
    participant Gateway as API网关
    participant TenantFilter as TenantContextFilter
    participant TenantCtx as TenantContext
    participant Handler as UserHandler
    participant Service as UserService
    participant TenantInterceptor as TenantLineInterceptor
    participant MyBatis as MyBatis-Plus
    participant MySQL as MySQL数据库
    
    Note over Client,MySQL: 多租户数据隔离完整流程
    
    Client->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/users<br/>Header: X-Tenant-Id=TENANT_A
    activate Gateway
    
    Gateway->>TenantFilter: 过滤器拦截<br/>Order: HIGHEST_PRECEDENCE+10
    activate TenantFilter
    Note right of TenantFilter: 提取租户头<br/>X-Tenant-Id
    
    TenantFilter->>TenantFilter: 验证租户ID格式<br/>检查租户状态
    
    alt 租户ID无效或租户已禁用
        TenantFilter--xGateway: 403 Forbidden
        Gateway--xClient: 租户无效
    else 租户ID有效
        TenantFilter->>TenantCtx: setTenantId(TENANT_A)
        activate TenantCtx
        Note right of TenantCtx: 写入ThreadLocal<br/>或Reactor Context
        
        TenantFilter-->>Gateway: 继续处理
        deactivate TenantFilter
        
        Gateway->>Handler: 路由到业务Handler
        activate Handler
        
        Handler->>Service: createUser(request)
        activate Service
        
        Service->>MyBatis: INSERT用户数据
        activate MyBatis
        
        MyBatis->>TenantInterceptor: SQL拦截<br/>beforeQuery
        activate TenantInterceptor
        Note right of TenantInterceptor: 从TenantContext获取<br/>租户ID: TENANT_A
        
        TenantInterceptor->>TenantInterceptor: 改写SQL<br/>自动添加WHERE条件
        Note right of TenantInterceptor: INSERT INTO sys_user<br/>(id, name, tenant_id)<br/>VALUES (?, ?, 'TENANT_A')
        
        TenantInterceptor-->>MyBatis: 返回改写后SQL
        deactivate TenantInterceptor
        
        MyBatis->>MySQL: 执行SQL<br/>tenant_id='TENANT_A'
        activate MySQL
        Note right of MySQL: 索引: idx_tenant_id<br/>确保隔离性能
        
        MySQL-->>MyBatis: 插入成功
        deactivate MySQL
        
        MyBatis-->>Service: 返回结果
        deactivate MyBatis
        
        Service-->>Handler: UserDTO
        deactivate Service
        
        Handler-->>Gateway: 200 OK
        deactivate Handler
        
        Gateway->>TenantCtx: 清理租户上下文<br/>doFinally
        TenantCtx->>TenantCtx: remove ThreadLocal
        deactivate TenantCtx
        
        Gateway-->>Client: 返回用户数据
        deactivate Gateway
    end
    
    Note over Client,MySQL: 关键保护点
    Note over TenantFilter: 1. 入口验证租户头不可伪造
    Note over TenantInterceptor: 2. SQL自动改写确保数据隔离
    Note over MySQL: 3. 数据库索引保证查询性能
